  "hints": [
    {
      "tr": "Tarihe süre eklemek: `DATEADD(birim, miktar, tarih)`. Birim burada `day`.",
      "en": "Adding time to a date: `DATEADD(unit, amount, date)`. The unit here is `day`."
    },
    {
      "tr": "Hesaplanan sütuna `AS due_date` ile ad ver; sonuç tipi yine tarih.",
      "en": "Name the calculated column with `AS due_date`; the result is still a date."
    },
    {
      "tr": "Sorgunun tamamı:\n\n```sql\nSELECT id, order_date,\n       DATEADD(day, 7, order_date) AS due_date\nFROM orders\nORDER BY id;\n```",
      "en": "The whole query:\n\n```sql\nSELECT id, order_date,\n       DATEADD(day, 7, order_date) AS due_date\nFROM orders\nORDER BY id;\n```"
    }
  ],
